  "vibe": "A neon shop after dark: near-black violet (#121016) lit only by hot pink (#ff3ec8) and ice blue (#2ee6ff), with warm bulb-white (#fff3d6) for type. Monoton — a real tube-outline face — sets titles at 1.22 line and 0.05em so the words read as bent glass. The backdrop is the workshop itself: a blue-bordered OPEN sign whose pink letters flicker on a two-frequency gate and bloom with a 14px drop-shadow when they catch; a glowing blue script squiggle; a pink hook bend; three marquee bulbs pulsing out of phase; a tilted bending-bench rack; and a slow-breathing pink tube coil. Statement beats keep the world lit behind them. It owns a POWER-ON click, a window-display switch list, a caret work order and a fade morph.",
